ork’s curtain of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"light, where the room you arrive in depends on state rather than on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the exit you took:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["depository.north { lastViewingRoom == .west ? smallRoom : vault }"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Travel runs through the same path as every other passable exit, so the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"destination’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"onEnter","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" rules fire and a boarded vehicle rides along —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which is the difference between this and assigning ","type":"text"},{"code":"player.location","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from a rule, where neither happens.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The closure is a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"read"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":": it may run more than once in a turn — FOLLOW","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"asks it which way the quarry went before travel takes it — so it must","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"answer from state rather than change any.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Two consequences of the destination being a closure:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It is not validated at bootstrap."}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" The other exit forms name a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"room the bootstrap can resolve; this one is opaque until it runs, so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a destination that isn’t a stored property of the game surfaces on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the turn the player takes the exit, not at l